{
  "info": {
    "name": "Housing & Roommate Platform API",
    "description": "B7A6 full workflow collection.\n\n## Base URLs\nThe collection points at the live deployment by default:\n- baseUrl: https://b7a6-assignment-backend.onrender.com/api/v1\n- rootUrl: https://b7a6-assignment-backend.onrender.com\n\nFor a local backend, change them to http://localhost:5000/api/v1 and http://localhost:5000. The free Render instance can take up to a minute to answer the first request after it has been idle.\n\nFrontend: https://b7a7-assignment-frontend.onrender.com\n\n## Demo accounts (created by `npx prisma db seed`)\n- ADMIN: admin@housing.com / ChangeMeAdmin123!\n- LANDLORD: landlord@housing.com / Landlord123!\n- TENANT: tenant@housing.com / Tenant123!\n\n## Suggested test order\n1. Auth → Login Admin / Landlord / Tenant (demo accounts) or Register your own. The login and register requests save the tokens into adminToken / landlordToken / tenantToken automatically.\n2. Landlord → Create Property (PUBLISHED) → Upload Property Photos → Create Room\n3. Tenant → Create Rental Request\n4. Landlord → Approve Request (creates Booking)\n5. Tenant → Initiate Payment (STRIPE or BKASH)\n6. Admin → Dashboard / Users / Audit logs\n\nGoogle login: the frontend sends the Google ID token to POST /auth/google. To call it from Postman, get an idToken from http://localhost:5000/google-signin while running the backend locally.\nForgot password: credential users only (not Google-only). In demo email mode the OTP is delivered to the project's demo inbox instead of the entered address.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "https://b7a6-assignment-backend.onrender.com/api/v1" },
    { "key": "rootUrl", "value": "https://b7a6-assignment-backend.onrender.com" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "adminToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "landlordToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "tenantToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "propertyId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "propertyImageId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "roomId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "rentalRequestId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "bookingId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "paymentId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "otp", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{rootUrl}}/health"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "API Root",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{rootUrl}}/"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register Landlord",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const d = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('landlordToken', d.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', d.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', d.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Rahim Landlord\",\n  \"email\": \"landlord@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123!\",\n  \"role\": \"LANDLORD\",\n  \"phone\": \"01700000001\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register Tenant",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const d = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('tenantToken', d.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', d.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', d.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Karim Tenant\",\n  \"email\": \"tenant@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123!\",\n  \"role\": \"TENANT\",\n  \"phone\": \"01700000002\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const d = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', d.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', d.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', d.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@housing.com\",\n  \"password\": \"ChangeMeAdmin123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Landlord",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const d = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('landlordToken', d.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', d.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', d.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"landlord@housing.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Landlord123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Tenant",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const d = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('tenantToken', d.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', d.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', d.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"tenant@housing.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Tenant123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Google Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const d = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', d.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', d.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"idToken\": \"PASTE_REAL_GOOGLE_ID_TOKEN_FROM_/google-signin\",\n  \"role\": \"TENANT\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/google",
            "description": "Signs in with a Google ID token; the account is created on first sign-in and linked by email if it already exists.\n\n- idToken (required): run the backend locally, open http://localhost:5000/google-signin, sign in and copy the token. The token must be issued for the backend's GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID.\n- role (optional): LANDLORD or TENANT. Only used when this sign-in creates a new account; defaults to TENANT. Existing accounts keep their role.\n\nReturns 503 \"Google login is not configured\" when GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID is not set, and 401 \"Invalid Google token\" for an invalid or expired token."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh-token"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Forgot Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"tenant@example.com\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password",
            "description": "Sends a 6-digit OTP by email (stored in Redis, valid for 5 minutes). Google-only users are rejected.\n\nThe response data includes email, expiresInSeconds, emailSent, deliveredTo and redirected. In demo email mode (Resend sandbox with RESEND_TEST_TO set) every OTP goes to the demo inbox: redirected is true, deliveredTo is that inbox, and the message reads \"OTP sent to the demo inbox ...\"."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"tenant@example.com\",\n  \"otp\": \"{{otp}}\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"NewPassword123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password",
            "description": "Paste OTP from email into collection variable otp."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
